efore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′} & =4^{x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{4^{x}}{\\ln{(4 )}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot 4^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{4^{x}}{\\ln{(4 )}}-\\int \\frac{4^{x}}{\\ln{(4 )}}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x4^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{4^{x} x}{\\ln{(4 )}}-\\int \\frac{4^{x}}{\\ln{(4 )}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\ln{(4 )}}\\cdot x4^{x}-\\frac{1}{\\ln{(4 )}^{2}}\\cdot 4^{x}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4^{x}}{\\ln{(4 )}}(x - \\frac{1}{\\ln{(4 )}})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCollecting the linear terms gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x4^{x}\\,\\mathrm{d}x & =\\left(\\frac{x}{\\ln{(4 )}} - \\frac{1}{\\ln{(4 )}^{2}}\\right)4^{x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186694100 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b31ff11-665c-5ceb-aa09-ce6857664124" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2 x e^{- x} - 2 e^{- x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694091} {:answer/id #uuid "3752c634-e59b-54c6-9538-3ad3b3ed2392" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2 x e^{- x} - 2 e^{- x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694097} {:answer/id #uuid "a8a6ba83-9504-542b-a023-cda0fa56347c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2 x e^{- x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694112} {:answer/id #uuid "d261cf9c-e09f-59e6-9e91-b721a36cb709" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4 x e^{- x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694116} {:answer/id #uuid "f259a477-16c0-57f8-bcdd-43ddb60d3a5d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2 x e^{- x} + 2 e^{- x}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186694120}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1b31ff11-665c-5ceb-aa09-ce6857664124" :answer/type {